OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786434482
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed in Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Cstrike deep inside Russia
OL,6,FA major Ukrainian drone strike has
OL,7,Fkilled at least 13 people, including a
OL,8,Fchild, and injured 75 others deep
OL,9,Finside Russia, according to local
OL,10,Fauthorities.
OL,12,FThe attack in the Tatarstan region is
OL,13,Fthe deadliest to hit the country in
OL,14,Fmore than two years.
OL,16,FUkraine's armed forces said they
OL,17,Ftargeted the Taneco oil refinery in
OL,18,FNizhnekamsk, a city more than 600
OL,19,Fmiles (1,000 kilometres) east of
OL,20,FMoscow.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
