PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786434482
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed in Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Cstrike deep inside Russia
OL,6,FTheir strategy in the conflict is to
OL,7,Ftake the fight to Russian facilities
OL,8,Fthat contribute revenue and logistics
OL,9,Fwith new advanced technologies, drones
OL,10,Fand missiles.
OL,12,FVideos circulating on social media
OL,13,Fshow a huge blaze raging and plumes of
OL,14,Fsmoke rising from an area just outside
OL,15,Fthe city, close to what appear to be
OL,16,Fthe characteristic towers of an oil
OL,17,Frefinery.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
