PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786434482
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed in Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Cstrike deep inside Russia
OL,6,FThe strike comes as both Russia and
OL,7,FUkraine intensify their aerial attacks
OL,8,Fagainst one another, while the
OL,9,Ffrontlines of the war largely stagnate.
OL,11,FMore drones and missiles are slipping
OL,12,Fthrough both sides' fraying air
OL,13,Fdefences, meaning that the civilian
OL,14,Fdeath toll has increased, and more
OL,15,Fcritical infrastructure is being
OL,16,Fdamaged.
OL,18,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,19,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,20,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,21,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
