OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786434482
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed in Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Cstrike deep inside Russia
OL,6,FJune was the deadliest month for
OL,7,Fattacks on Ukrainian civilians since
OL,8,FApril 2022, as 1,396 were killed and
OL,9,F7,978 were injured, the UN said
OL,10,Frecently.
OL,12,FA child was among those killed in
OL,13,FNizhnekamsk, according to the Russian
OL,14,FInvestigative Committee, while 21
OL,15,Fpeople have been hospitalised, the
OL,16,Fregion's press service said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
