OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786434482
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed in Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Cstrike deep inside Russia
OL,6,FAnother four people were killed over
OL,7,Fthe last 24 hours in the Russian
OL,8,Fregion of Belgorod, which borders
OL,9,FUkraine, the region's acting governor
OL,10,FAlexandr Shuvayev said.
OL,12,FUkrainian President Volodymyr
OL,13,FZelenskyy says Russia will 'really
OL,14,Ffeel' operations targeting its oil
OL,15,Frefining:
OL,17,FA period of mourning has been declared
OL,18,Fin Tatarstan.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
