PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786434482
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed in Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Cstrike deep inside Russia
OL,6,FNizhnekamsk mayor Radmir Belayev
OL,7,Fconfirmed the strike and shared his
OL,8,Fcondolences with the families of those
OL,9,Fkilled, adding: "This is a tremendous
OL,10,Fpain for all of us."
OL,12,FAs Ukraine's long-range drone
OL,13,Ftechnology has improved in recent
OL,14,Fmonths, it has demonstrated a newfound
OL,15,Fability to frequently strike
OL,16,Finfrastructure deep inside Russia,
OL,17,Flike oil refineries, tankers, power
OL,18,Fsubstations and broader energy
OL,19,Finfrastructure as well as warehouses
OL,20,Fbelonging to its largest online
OL,21,Fretailer.
OL,26,@qD@QOUrD@TO]
