CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1786434482
OL,3,CAt least 13 killed in Ukrainian drone
OL,4,Cstrike deep inside Russia
OL,6,FLast month, attacks on Wildberries -
OL,7,Fthe nation's equivalent of Amazon -
OL,8,Fkilled at least eight people in a
OL,9,Fsingle day, which, up until Monday's
OL,10,Fstrike on Nizhnekamsk, was the worst
OL,11,Finside Russia.
OL,13,FRussia's daily aerial assaults on
OL,14,FUkraine still vastly outnumber Kyiv's
OL,15,Fretaliatory attacks. In just one night
OL,16,Fearlier this month, missiles killed at
OL,17,Fleast 17 people and injured dozens of
OL,18,Fothers in the Kyiv region.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
